WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Bob isn't just a police chief, he's a DEI consultant.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.080
Chief Day took a hiatus during the summer of love

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.480
to go work for a DEI nonprofit called the Red Door Project.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.880
What's their mission?

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.560
Reimagine policing.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.719
This is what Bob was doing with his time

00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:20.840
before Antifa burnt down Portland the last time.

